      en: ["The reserve is situated at an altitude of approximately 1,050 meters", "The peat layer reaches a depth of 20 meters in certain spots", "It is home to Drosera rotundifolia, a rare carnivorous plant species", "The volcanic crater has a diameter of about 800 meters", "The total area of the nature reserve is roughly 80 hectares", "Visitors can only access the bog via wooden paths with a guide"],
      es: ["El pantano se formó hace unos 10.000 años.", "La superficie es de unas 80 hectáreas.", "Se encuentra en el cráter de un volcán extinguido.", "Aquí crece la drosera de hojas redondas (Drosera rotundifolia).", "El valor del pH del agua es inferior a 4,5.", "La capa de turba tiene hasta 10 metros de espesor."],
